<title>HUNGARY: Budapest bourse suspends trading in Domus.</title>
<headline>Budapest bourse suspends trading in Domus.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange suspended trading in shares of furniture retailer Domus for the rest of the day after too rapid an intraday rise, traders told Reuters.</p>
<p>Domus shares opened at 400 forints and surged 25 percent to 500 forints, triggering its suspension. The last deal in Domus was made at 1117 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
